PRODUCT BROWSING AND SORTING


| Field | Details |
|-------|---------|
| Test Case ID | TC_PRODUCT_001 |
| Linked Scenario | TS_PRODUCT_001 |
| Title | Verify that products are displayed with names, descriptions and prices |
| Preconditions | SauceDemo is accessible, and the user is logged in and viewing the Products page |
| Test Data | Username: `standard_user`; Password: `secret_sauce` |
| Test Steps | 1. View the Products page<br>2. Inspect the displayed product listings<br>3. Check that each product has a name, description and price |
| Expected Result | Each displayed product has a visible name, description and price. |


| Field | Details |
|-------|---------|
| Test Case ID | TC_PRODUCT_002 |
| Linked Scenario | TS_PRODUCT_002 |
| Title | Verify that products can be sorted by price in ascending and descending order |
| Preconditions | User is logged in and viewing the Products page |
| Test Data | Sort options: Price (low to high), Price (high to low) |
| Test Steps | 1. Locate the sorting dropdown on the Products page<br>2. Select Price (low to high)<br>3. Check the displayed product prices from top to bottom<br>4. Select Price (high to low)<br>5. Check the displayed product prices again |
| Expected Result | Low to high: Prices appear in ascending order, from cheapest to most expensive.<br>High to low:** Prices appear in descending order, from most expensive to cheapest. |


| Field | Details |
|---|---|
| Test Case ID | TC_PRODUCT_003 |
| Linked Scenario | TS_PRODUCT_003 |
| Title | Verify that products can be sorted alphabetically by name from A to Z and Z to A |
| Preconditions | SauceDemo is accessible, and the user is logged in and viewing the Products page |
| Test Data | Sort options: Name (A to Z), Name (Z to A) |
| Test Steps | 1. Locate the sorting dropdown.<br>2. Select Name (A to Z).<br>3. Check the displayed product names from top to bottom.<br>4. Select Name (Z to A).<br>5. Check the displayed product names again. |
| Expected Result | Products are displayed alphabetically in ascending order (A to Z) and descending order (Z to A), according to the selected sorting option. |


SHOPPING CART

| Field | Details |
|---|---|
| Test Case ID | TC_CART_001 |
| Linked Scenario | TS_CART_001 |
| Title | Verify that a user can add a product to the shopping cart successfully |
| Preconditions | User is logged in and viewing the Products page |
| Test Data | Product: Sauce Labs Backpack |
| Test Steps | 1. Locate Sauce Labs Backpack on the Products page.<br>2. Click Add to cart.<br>3. Click the shopping cart icon.<br>4. Check the products displayed in the cart. |
| Expected Result | Sauce Labs Backpack appears in the shopping cart, and the cart badge reflects the added item. |


| Field | Details |
|---|---|
| Test Case ID | TC_CART_002 |
| Linked Scenario | TS_CART_002 |
| Title | Verify that a user can remove a product from the shopping cart successfully |
| Preconditions | User is logged in, and Sauce Labs Fleece Jacket has already been added to the shopping cart |
| Test Data | Product: Sauce Labs Fleece Jacket |
| Test Steps | 1. Click the shopping cart icon.<br>2. Locate Sauce Labs Fleece Jacket in the cart.<br>3. Click Remove beside the product.<br>4. Check the cart contents and cart badge. |
| Expected Result | Sauce Labs Fleece Jacket is no longer displayed in the cart, and the cart badge updates to reflect the remaining number of items |


| Field | Details |
|---|---|
| Test Case ID | TC_CART_003 |
| Linked Scenario | TS_CART_003 |
| Title | Verify that products remain in the shopping cart when navigating between the Products and Cart pages |
| Preconditions | User is logged in and viewing the Products page |
| Test Data | Product: Sauce Labs Fleece Jacket |
| Test Steps | 1. Locate Sauce Labs Fleece Jacket on the Products page.<br>2. Click Add to cart.<br>3. Click the shopping cart icon to open the Cart page.<br>4. Click Continue Shopping to return to the Products page.<br>5. Click the shopping cart icon again.<br>6. Check the cart contents. |
| Expected Result | Sauce Labs Fleece Jacket remains in the cart after navigation, and the cart badge correctly reflects the number of items. |

| Field | Details |
|---|---|
| Test Case ID | TC_CART_004 |
| Linked Scenario | TS_CART_004 |
| Title | Verify that the shopping cart displays added products with the correct details |
| Preconditions | User is logged in and viewing the Products page |
| Test Data | Product: Sauce Labs Fleece Jacket |
| Test Steps | 1. Locate Sauce Labs Fleece Jacket on the Products page.<br>2. Note its name, description and price.<br>3. Click Add to cart.<br>4. Click the shopping cart icon.<br>5. Check the product name, description, price and quantity displayed in the cart. |
| Expected Result | Sauce Labs Fleece Jacket appears in the cart with the same name, description and price shown on the Products page. Its quantity is 1. |
